{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"765ddcb1-3e5f-42d4-aae1-f40f1e0f99e0","status":"SUCCESS","response":"### Cause\nIn Flutter (`posthog_flutter`), PostHog session replay captures visual frames by taking screenshots of the widget tree via `PostHogWidget`. Without `PostHogWidget`, events and screen transitions (via `PosthogObserver`) are still sent, but no replay frames are captured.\n\n[`LegacyApp`](file:///tmp/h-SetrRO/lib/legacy_app.dart#L8-L26) wrapped its `MaterialApp` in `PostHogWidget`, whereas [`NewApp`](file:///tmp/h-SetrRO/lib/new_app.dart#L19-L36) returned `MaterialApp.router` directly without `PostHogWidget`.\n\n### Fix\n1. Wrapped `MaterialApp.router` in `PostHogWidget` inside [`NewApp.build`](file:///tmp/h-SetrRO/lib/new_app.dart#L22-L35) and added an explanatory comment in both [`lib/new_app.dart`](file:///tmp/h-SetrRO/lib/new_app.dart#L24-L25) and [`lib/legacy_app.dart`](file:///tmp/h-SetrRO/lib/legacy_app.dart#L13-L14).\n2. Documented the root cause, fix, and breakdown of which parts of the colleague's note applied (and which were already in place or did not apply) in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-SetrRO/ANSWER.md).\n","duration_seconds":83.513179,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":29570,"output_tokens":2350,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":85245,"total_tokens":31920}}}
